00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:15.460
I really liked how Adventures of Lolo 1, um, it, it seemed like there were a bunch of different ways to interact with the puzzle and, uh, that made you more like, oh, like, this is a weird emergent behavior that you can take advantage of or stuff like that.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:20.480
