00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:08.380
Uh, this all sounds weird if you don't know what I'm talking about, but basically, like, they got enough hints from the developers because nobody could figure it out on their own.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.700
Oh. Yeah.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.900
Uh, so when you make things that hard.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:17.840
Wasn't there recently, like, a two-player mode discovered in, like, a classic NES game?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:19.320
