Lost levels, whatever.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:51.880
You forgot. I felt like it was, uh, it was a lot sooner in this game that I came upon levels where I was like, okay, this is going to take me some thinking.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:58.120
