00:09:34.060 --> 00:09:36.880
So you solved all the puzzles in adventures of Lolo one.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.920
And now you're like, just give me more of that.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:39.900
I want to play that.

