00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:16.180
This isn't a bad idea.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:25.280
Yeah. I, I feel like it's so not cut and dry as to like how a sequel could work, at least, at least how it could work for me.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:35.460
But I feel like you don't see this very often, like a sequel that is just like using the same, the same elements of the previous game.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.020
And like, let's just make more of the game.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.100
Let's make another full game like that.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:44.760
You know, I always think that it's probably, you know, probably never hurts to like add some tools, add some stuff.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:55.860
