00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.020
That's like in that style.

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:22.060
So like, I kind of appreciated this, like Adventures of Lolo.

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:28.180
And like, you know, maybe they could have made some other side scrolling or some other version that would have been really cool too.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.140
