00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:45.080
And as far as like getting you right into it, I, I did like that, uh, that it felt like it moved a little quicker because the puzzles, it's not like they're crazy hard, but it did feel like each puzzle pretty early on became like, okay, like a little bit of an event.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.080
