00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:45.300
Uh, cause I was thinking more modern games where this kind of equivalent could happen.

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:59.220
And portal two is a good example, but even just thinking about something that didn't happen, uh, the witness, if they just made, you know, 30 new puzzles and called it the witness to, uh, nobody is looking for that necessarily.

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:07.280
Right. Because that was a, um, an experience in itself to play that game and unravel, um, the mystery of it.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:15.540
