00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:28.360
But nevertheless, that is kind of what adventures of Lolo two laid down.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:43.640
Not that they are at all the same kind of puzzle game, but the idea remains the same that like, I don't know if adventures of Lolo two could get away with this in 2023, um, at, uh, you know, for any other, uh, means.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:16:00.920
That, that, that being said though, like in terms of the witness and I've only played a bit of it, but I would say that the puzzles in the witness at like the base level puzzles, not like the higher concept ones where you're like solving puzzles out of puzzles.

