00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:26.960
You know, like, there's no, there's no, like, dynamic environment things that were changed.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:34.960
Right. And I think that that's, if you're, like, if a lot of these enemies that do these unique things are different, like, to me that's, that's plenty of a change.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.840
Not saying that I wouldn't welcome other changes.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:40.820
But, like, that's different than adding a jump where it's like, oh, there's just new enemies.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.380
