00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:18.360
But it does make, it does make it so, like, I'm not brute forcing my way through this by just trial and error.

00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:22.840
Like, it, it. Yeah, I think we had a discussion, ugh.

00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:29.640
