00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:22.060
Like, I'm not against new mechanics like that, but I, for me, I just think adding new, adding new enemies with new, with new, like, behaviors is what, like, actually really significantly would change the game enough.

00:25:22.060 --> 00:25:23.760
Like, depending on the behaviors.

00:25:24.020 --> 00:25:28.780
