00:27:09.860 --> 00:27:13.940
Or just affect the, affect the playing field in some way.

00:27:14.100 --> 00:27:21.040
I think that would be a big enough change that also, uh, uh, gives you some input.

00:27:21.040 --> 00:27:22.800
